+path list in memory (`docs-fresh-integration.log`); its ordinary invocation
+on the clean worktree has no changed paths. Semantic document review establishes
+the current registration, workload and remaining integration claims. The
+evaluation Reference's older “runs first” wording is clarified by its explicit
+merge section's current guard order; it does not indicate a behavioral gap.
+
+No real CUDA/Inductor run, native Kaggriculture rollout, teacher execution or
+end-to-end training qualification is claimed. Those documented gaps are outside
