+Final tracked worktree/index and HEAD identity checks are recorded in
+`status-after.txt` and `final-identity.json`. Review artifacts live only in the
+ignored `.codex-tmp/verify-merge-trainer-lanes-r2/` directory.
+
+VERDICT: APPROVE

